  "title": "Choose the appropriate assurance description",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Choose the appropriate assurance description</h2><p>Review four proposed report descriptions before they are sent to clients.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f1\">Description for A</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Limited assurance\">Limited assurance</option><option value=\"Absolute assurance\">Absolute assurance</option><option value=\"No possible follow-up procedures\">No possible follow-up procedures</option><option value=\"A guarantee of future solvency\">A guarantee of future solvency</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f2\">Description for B</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"No assurance\">No assurance</option><option value=\"Reasonable assurance\">Reasonable assurance</option><option value=\"Absolute assurance\">Absolute assurance</option><option value=\"An audit opinion\">An audit opinion</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f3\">Description for C</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Reasonable assurance\">Reasonable assurance</option><option value=\"A guarantee of every outcome\">A guarantee of every outcome</option><option value=\"No assurance in every examination\">No assurance in every examination</option><option value=\"Only a list of findings with no conclusion\">Only a list of findings with no conclusion</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f4\">Description for D</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Procedures performed and findings\">Procedures performed and findings</option><option value=\"An opinion on all federal compliance\">An opinion on all federal compliance</option><option value=\"A guarantee of grant renewal\">A guarantee of grant renewal</option><option value=\"A full financial-statement audit opinion\">A full financial-statement audit opinion</option></select></div></section>",
