  "explanation": "<h3>Description for A</h3><p>A review provides limited assurance.</p><h3>Description for B</h3><p>A compilation provides no assurance.</p><h3>Description for C</h3><p>An examination provides reasonable assurance against suitable criteria.</p><h3>Description for D</h3><p>Agreed-upon procedures report procedures and findings, not broader assurance.</p>"
